Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.61,0:02:15.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NListen, when I get a bounty,\Nit's gonna be twice as much as yours.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.72,0:02:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhatever, Pirate C.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.95,0:02:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NStop changing it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.09,0:02:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NHey, stop you two.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.00,0:02:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI don't think they can\Nhear you, Sniper King.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.98,0:02:23.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NDon't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.68,0:02:25.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all part of my plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.45,0:02:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI don't get it, but it sounds cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.45,0:02:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NThere's more of them over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.57,0:02:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING & CHOPPER]\NThey found us!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.97,0:02:32.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NSome might be hiding on the train!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.51,0:02:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blow it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.38,0:02:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHey! Stop! Nami's still inside there!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.61,0:02:36.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NFire!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.49,0:02:45.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThat hurt!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.69,0:02:47.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.46,0:02:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sniper King?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.66,0:02:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NNever better, my friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.80,0:02:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NCease fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NWhat's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.46,0:02:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NSee for yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY & KOKORO]\NHi!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NDon't shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just an old lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NI'm a little girl with a kitty cat!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.77,0:03:06.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're too cute to die!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GONBE]\NMeow! Meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.36,0:03:10.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NThe Straw Hat Pirates threatened\Nto do all kinds of rude
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.84,0:03:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and immoral stuff if I didn't\Noperate the train for them!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.99,0:03:15.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NThose meanies!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.42,0:03:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GONBE]\NMeow! Meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.60,0:03:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would let their hostages get drunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.77,0:03:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NThat was close!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.70,0:03:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We almost blew up\Nthat innocent old lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.81,0:03:28.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NWhat kind of deranged\Nmonster would take
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.61,0:03:32.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a senior citizen, a little girl,\Nand a cat as hostages?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.96,0:03:36.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NIs it just me, or is that\Nsmoke forming a cloud?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.13,0:03:38.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NUsing cool balls.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.30,0:03:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And heat balls.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.14,0:03:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can turn the moisture\Nin the air into clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NAww, there you are Nami-sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.27,0:03:47.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd make it out okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.29,0:03:52.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHe didn't name it the "Perfect\NClima Takt" for nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.82,0:03:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These clouds are growing a lot\Nbigger and faster than before!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.41,0:03:59.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The question is, how\Nstrong are the thunderbolts?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.53,0:04:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is looking scary, guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.67,0:04:06.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's prob'ly better to run, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.20,0:04:07.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.74,0:04:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause here comes the\Nnew Thunderbolt Tempo!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.27,0:04:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NYou trying to kill me or what?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.20,0:04:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAh!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NNami, why'd you hit Sniper King?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.91,0:04:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.84,0:04:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I felt like it?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.94,0:04:40.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NDon't take it out on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.34,0:04:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault you\Ndon't know how to use it yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.94,0:04:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, Usopp told me he\Nnever added a feature like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.51,0:04:49.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either way.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.19,0:04:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That thing is crazy powerful!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.64,0:04:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You beat everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.12,0:04:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NDamn it, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.82,0:04:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.52,0:05:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch where you aim that thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.25,0:05:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apologize to him, Sniper King!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.15,0:05:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NYou apologize, stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.16,0:05:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI haven't felt a shock like that since\Nthe first time I met you, Nami-swan.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.56,0:05:10.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NThose pirates are out of control.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.73,0:05:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.70,0:05:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought that girl\Nwas just the navigator,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it turns out she's as\Nstrong as the rest of 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSo anyway, what about our Captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any guesses on where he went?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWho knows.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The island's pretty big.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.49,0:05:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where should we start?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.53,0:05:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EVERYONE]\NThat's got to be where he's at.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.94,0:05:35.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NAll right, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.62,0:05:37.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NLet's get moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.96,0:05:48.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WATCHDOG CAPTAIN]\NYou filthy criminals think the\NWatchdogs'll let you do as you please?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.30,0:05:49.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.63,0:06:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NHe jumped onto the tree!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.16,0:06:21.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.76,0:06:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't those dumb jerks\Nhave anything better to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.26,0:06:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NThis way! Quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're running the other way?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.72,0:06:31.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NHalf of you, head to the\Nmain island front gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.18,0:06:33.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates forced it open\Nand are invading the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop them at any cost!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.90,0:06:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}All right, now that everyone else's here\NI can finally stop running from these guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.31,0:06:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NGot him!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.21,0:06:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.88,0:06:43.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NTry again!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.91,0:06:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NHe's over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.91,0:06:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.50,0:07:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are the Watchdogs, guards\Nof the island's front gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.84,0:07:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've run rampant for\Nfar too long, villains!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.68,0:07:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No criminal shall cross this line!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYep, I'd say they've\Ngot us surrounded all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.79,0:07:34.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI & SOGEKING]\NWere they following us all this time?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.98,0:07:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.78,0:07:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.25,0:07:39.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cocky little scoundrel!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.31,0:07:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right men, let's a...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.53,0:07:49.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NGrab on!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.43,0:07:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.07,0:08:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coulda let us have\Nsome fun first, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\N{\an8}You idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.41,0:08:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the reason you came here!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save your energy for the real fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.74,0:08:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.68,0:08:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd be here all day\Nwith that many guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.79,0:08:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those kiddos are full of energy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't die out there!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.14,0:08:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NGo save your friend!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GONBE]\NMeow, meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.75,0:08:37.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NEverybody!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.78,0:08:39.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NIt's a King Bull from Water 7!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.62,0:08:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready the cannons!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.39,0:08:49.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.95,0:08:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Family coming through!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.56,0:09:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watchdogs, back in\Nformation immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.64,0:09:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WATCHDOGS]\NRoger!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.78,0:09:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WATCHDOG CAPTAIN]\NYou can run away if you\Nlike, but our dogs aren't going
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.55,0:09:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to lose to a couple of overgrown fish!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.08,0:09:10.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.78,0:09:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna jump up on the bull!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.82,0:09:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.52,0:09:15.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NCan't we go any faster?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.02,0:09:17.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NHey, Cook.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.09,0:09:20.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat's up?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NYou take the reins.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.55,0:09:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWait.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.06,0:09:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.90,0:09:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you see 'em, I want you\Nto pass on a message for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.27,0:09:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"You're all fired."
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.01,0:09:50.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.01,0:09:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WATCHDOG]\NAll right, jump!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.82,0:09:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NNot so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.25,0:09:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Galley-La, we're\Nleaving this one to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.35,0:09:59.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WATCHDOG]\NWe're gonna skewer you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.16,0:10:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NHalf Knot Air Drive!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.37,0:10:08.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NWhoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.86,0:10:13.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He took out those\NWatchdogs out in one hit!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.63,0:10:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.33,0:10:15.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They just let their guard down!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.77,0:10:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No mere human can match our speed!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.28,0:10:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give them a taste of canine power, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.85,0:10:21.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They won't know what hit 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WATCHDOG]\NStrike 'like lightning!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.68,0:10:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NNot them too!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.37,0:10:36.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NWho are these guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.23,0:10:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.09,0:10:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NYou ready for round two?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.25,0:11:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.08,0:11:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems your temperament is as\Nvolatile as ever, Cutty Flam.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.51,0:11:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even though we haven't\Nseen each other in years,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.01,0:11:16.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it turns out that you've caused\Nme quite a bit of trouble;
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.85,0:11:19.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,faking your death and hiding\Nthe blueprints, I mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.91,0:11:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's ironic.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.01,0:11:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could've arrested you had\NI known you were alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your old charges never\Nwere cleared were they?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.96,0:11:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NSpeaking of thorns in my side,\Nyour old friend Iceberg
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.19,0:11:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has given me quite the hassle as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.54,0:11:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bringing together all the ship\Nbuilders in Water 7 was quite crafty.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.64,0:11:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The resulting Galley-La Company turned\Ninto a force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.24,0:11:46.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though he must've resented the government,\Nhe allied with us all the same.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And before we knew it,\Nwe were reliant on
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.09,0:11:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,his company to provide\Nships for the entire Navy.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.24,0:11:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not only was he the president\Nof the Galley-La Company.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.21,0:11:58.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was also the mayor of Water Seven.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.81,0:12:01.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, he was\Npopular with the public
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.81,0:12:05.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we dealt with him carelessly,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.17,0:12:11.00,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I've heard that your\Ncompany has been contracted
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,to build ships for the\NWorld Government!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.07,0:12:15.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NI won't tolerate you helping them!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.02,0:12:17.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you, after\Nwhat they did to Tom?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.32,0:12:21.63,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NSo that's why he made a\Ndeal with those bastards.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.63,0:12:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NI admit, he's a very clever man!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.50,0:12:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or was.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had almost lost my patience.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.37,0:12:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the wind hadn't blown\Nin my favor when it did,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.71,0:12:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was ready to resort\Nto extreme measures.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.55,0:12:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, Admiral Aokiji sent\Nsome good news my way.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.95,0:12:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said that our little friend\NNico Robin was on a pirate ship,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.96,0:12:46.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,headed to Water Seven for repairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.68,0:12:50.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, I had to calm down and\Nthink about it over a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.95,0:12:54.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But fortunately, with the\NBuster Call at my disposal,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it was quite easy to formulate a plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.76,0:13:00.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Little did I know, the result would\Nexceed my wildest expectations.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.93,0:13:02.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.17,0:13:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both of the triggers needed to revive the\NAncient Weapon are right here at my mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.60,0:13:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NYou get it, now?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.83,0:13:14.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I say the winds of this\Nworld are blowing in my favor,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.70,0:13:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I most assuredly mean it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.97,0:13:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every man and every nation in\Nthe world must answer to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.91,0:13:30.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that power at\Nthe tip of my fingers!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.77,0:13:31.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NI don't understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.91,0:13:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would Aokiji allow you\Nto invoke the Buster Call?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.33,0:13:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NWhat gives you the\Nright to question me?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.77,0:14:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.17,0:14:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NYou get to play a part in\Nthe rebirth of this world!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.34,0:14:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough for you,\Nyou insolent witch?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.15,0:14:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, you should even be thanking me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.38,0:14:15.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.09,0:14:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll cleanse this world of Ohara's\Nlegacy by bleeding you dry.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NNow listen, and listen well.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.64,0:14:28.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From this moment on, I'm going to make you\Nsuffer pain so excruciatingly agonizing
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.68,0:14:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that you'll wake up every\Nmorning wishing you were dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.48,0:14:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.08,0:14:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hurt you and use you\Nthen throw you out into the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.09,0:14:41.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A life as sinful as\Nyours deserves nothing less!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.17,0:14:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NOh, and by the way, I just\Nreceived some interesting news.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.99,0:14:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apparently, a moronic\Ngroup of riff-raff has decided
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.36,0:14:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to infiltrate our island in a\Nhapless attempt to rescue you.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't mean...?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.80,0:15:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.80,0:15:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.75,0:15:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they've been\Napprehended by now.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.42,0:15:10.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy and his\Ncrew will trouble us no more.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.37,0:15:13.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThey're so stubborn.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.61,0:15:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're little more\Nthan insects compared
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.38,0:15:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the might of the ten thousand\Nsoldiers of Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.05,0:15:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Conveniently, we were already\Npreparing a prison transport ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.89,0:15:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What perfect timing they have!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Along with Cutty Flam, they'll\Nmake a wonderful addition
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.45,0:15:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as the latest inmates of Impel Down.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.83,0:15:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.63,0:15:39.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't part of our agreement!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.63,0:15:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In exchange for my\Ncooperation and surrender,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.93,0:15:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you promised that you'd let\Nthe Straw Hats escape safely!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.44,0:15:48.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NCome now!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.37,0:15:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NWhat are you getting\Nso worked up about?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.11,0:15:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.24,0:15:54.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remind her of the exact\Nconditions that were offered!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.75,0:15:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\N{\q2}The terms of the arrangement were, that\Nexcluding Nico Robin, the Straw Hat Pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.95,0:16:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,would be allowed to\Nleave Water 7 safely.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.39,0:16:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NCorrect.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.49,0:16:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.09,0:16:07.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fairly straightforward, I'd say.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.32,0:16:16.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After allowing them\Nto leave Water 7 safely,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.02,0:16:20.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as promised, the Straw Hats\Ndecided to come here.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.67,0:16:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NIs this some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.34,0:16:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're going to break the heart of our\Nagreement over a ridiculous technicality?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.51,0:16:31.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These dirtbags are\Nthe lowest of the low.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.02,0:16:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a shred of decency\Nin any one of 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.62,0:16:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.96,0:16:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.24,0:16:39.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NShut up, you filthy piece of trash!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.02,0:16:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not under any obligation to keep\Nour promises to a bunch of criminals!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.76,0:16:45.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.09,0:16:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take that, and that, and that!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.73,0:16:48.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.06,0:16:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky with me, understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.43,0:16:56.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deceiving and capturing pirates is\Nwhat the Navy does, you insolent wench!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just the idiot who fell for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.08,0:17:10.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.78,0:17:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll choose a fitting death for one
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NYou coward.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.68,0:17:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who's spent her life lying,\Ndeceiving, and betraying others.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.99,0:17:25.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NBefore the supreme power of\Njustice, resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.16,0:17:30.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But look on the bright side, at least\Nyour friends will suffer and die with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.96,0:17:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.66,0:17:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's all that commotion about?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.87,0:17:49.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NSomething's coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NWay to go, Sodom and Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep charging forward!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.16,0:18:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NOh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.86,0:18:10.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.03,0:18:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those pirates that broke\Nthrough the Main Island's Gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.80,0:18:13.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NFire!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.63,0:18:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let up!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.40,0:18:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YOKOZUNA]\NGero, Gero! Gero, Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.83,0:18:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NUnless you wanna die,\Nget outta the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.40,0:18:20.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NTake that!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.10,0:18:20.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.86,0:18:25.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NFall back and then restore formation!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.58,0:18:28.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NDamn!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.28,0:18:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.98,0:18:31.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be so cocky!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.63,0:18:39.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NNow I've got you, pirate lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NGet outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.25,0:18:49.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.08,0:18:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smooth sailing.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These two make it easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.12,0:18:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep going until we reach\Nour Captain, King Bulls!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.00,0:18:58.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NHurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.10,0:19:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.17,0:19:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surround him!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.87,0:19:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.94,0:19:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NMove!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.08,0:19:11.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGet outta my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.31,0:19:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NStupid bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.05,0:19:19.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NCommander!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.75,0:19:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy's really scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.92,0:19:23.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[COMMANDER]\NDon't falter, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.22,0:19:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring him down!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.19,0:19:26.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.62,0:19:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NCommander!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There! Yep!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.49,0:19:38.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That dead end's gotta be the place!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.93,0:19:41.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They better not\Nhave taken you away yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.57,0:19:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.64,0:19:49.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NI suppose that's enough for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.51,0:19:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get them out of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.31,0:19:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUARDS]\NYes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.42,0:19:54.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NThere's a Sea Prism Stone\Nlock on her restraints.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.95,0:19:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure it's secure.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.33,0:20:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam goes to Impel Down and\NNico Robin to Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.27,0:20:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As soon as the ship's ready, we'll\Nset sail through the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.31,0:20:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUARDS]\NRight!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.21,0:20:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It shall be done, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.17,0:20:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NAlso, take extra\Nprecautions with Cutty Flam.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.88,0:20:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can be extremely violen...\N[BLUENO] Has Straw Hat been sighted?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.54,0:20:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\N{\an8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.14,0:20:23.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FUKURO]\NWe got a report about it a\Nlittle while back, chapapa.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When he heard the news,\NChief got so worked up.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.72,0:20:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was embarrassing.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.42,0:20:31.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NThey said there were only five\Ncasualties, but that can't be right.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.16,0:20:36.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NThe receiver is off the hook.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.03,0:20:39.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUARD]\NDon't give us any trouble, tough guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.83,0:20:41.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.24,0:20:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can return to\Nyour quarters for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.89,0:20:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this catch, CP9 will be\Nthe toast of Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.60,0:21:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our status will rise to incredible\Nheights, in a covert way, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.60,0:21:07.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And for that, I'd like to propose\Na little toast of our own!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.38,0:21:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the mood\Nfor some ridiculous toast.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.38,0:21:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nor am I interested in our\Nstatus or political influence.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.88,0:21:21.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NOur brand of justice is to assassinate\Nin the name of the World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.65,0:21:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as they continue to recognize\Nyou as the commander of CP9,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.42,0:21:29.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we will fulfill our duty to the letter.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.96,0:21:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we're under no obligation\Nto support your personal ideologies.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.22,0:21:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NThat's... That's a sound argument.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.36,0:21:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But then, what is it you want exactly?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.60,0:21:47.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NPerhaps all that we seek is blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.07,0:22:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NAnd with CP9, we have\Nthe privilege to kill.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.47,0:22:06.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These guys give me the creeps.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.29,0:22:11.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NLike he said, they assassinate\Nlegally in the name of justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.00,0:22:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they're very good at what they do.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.20,0:22:15.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite dependable.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.23,0:22:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as I have them working for me,\Nthere's nothing I can't accomplish!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.31,0:22:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.63,0:22:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\N{\an8}Lieutenant Commander!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.36,0:22:30.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Terrible news!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.63,0:22:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LT. COMMANDER]\N{\an8}What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.91,0:22:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NIt's Straw Hat Luffy, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.32,0:22:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NWe can't find him anywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.08,0:22:39.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He gave us the slip!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.09,0:22:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LT. COMMANDER]\NThat's impossible!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.22,0:22:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got thousands of\NMarines here looking for him!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.65,0:22:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NEven so, no one can find him!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.78,0:22:46.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.69,0:22:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he somehow already\Ninside the courthouse?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.23,0:22:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NNo!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.46,0:22:53.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even an insect could've\Ngotten past our defenses, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.51,0:22:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LT. COMMANDER]\NGo!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.44,0:22:58.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must find Straw Hat\Nat any cost, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.19,0:23:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the last building.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.29,0:23:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's gotta be here.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.36,0:23:09.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there isn't a bridge.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.96,0:23:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks kinda far, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.39,0:23:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.06,0:23:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll try jumping over.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.82,0:23:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat the heck?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.27,0:23:22.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NAir Door.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.33,0:23:32.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.70,0:23:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the bull who's working\Nwith that stupid pigeon guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.70,0:23:39.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\N{\q2}There seem to be some discrepancies between\Nthe report and the actual situation.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.47,0:23:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.17,0:23:41.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you just appear like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.81,0:23:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.14,0:23:44.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.17,0:23:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NTo be honest, it did\Nseem a little suspicious.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.24,0:23:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way you only took out 5 marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.75,0:23:50.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NMan, you really surprised me!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.95,0:23:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NAn invasion like this is unprecedented.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.42,0:23:56.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the furthest\Nanyone has ever infiltrated
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.32,0:23:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,into the mouth of the World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.63,0:24:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that ends here.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.35,0:24:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NTell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.05,0:24:05.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How long do you plan to keep fighting?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.20,0:24:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NUntil I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NHey wait! I think I know that guy with the\Nsword!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:02.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NYeah! He's one of Straw Hat Luffy's Henchmen.\NPirate Hunter Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHenchman, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:07.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NLeast he recognized me. You're not even a\Nhenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Pirate A.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.07,0:02:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NMaybe "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNow, Gum-Gum Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey. Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NStill running that mouth of yours, I see.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
